      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "227",
        "2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8916e0b3b90d7c44a234ea1a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "瞩目的新星",
      "source_fingerprint": "b7b09f0949826fae8951ecfbf23201cef7aa7d6187da749e409902fb23eb31f4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "227",
        "3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:25a3bac771b1b3bd0cb3ef32",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "如日中天的",
      "source_fingerprint": "430c094411e784663917696420366394e4670f64cb2d1f8e15317686623a4eaf",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "227",
        "4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d61cac5bcb71c20905430f3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "被评为强者的",
      "source_fingerprint": "9668c559ec2d385beb5aa7266b08bf92cea7940401b6aa103c9cfe4c52c374b8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "227",
        "5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d313f98969f8f9cf1dde24f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "背负传说盛名的",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd84c241645fbc035c941cf61c7348550fcc0f56437e80c17e1ec46591ee7211",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "227",
        "6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a4efa850f109abca2c492e6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "听了之后……脚上充满力量。\\n就像拥有日本第一的证明一样，\\n有种……我必须加油的感觉！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2632d5bf7a662f65b47fa2cdccee317c4d3938e5c9fdecbc7d2cc983e034d819",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f1de682a16bb545e5b6116de",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "拿出全力的劲敌啊……\\n能有那样的人与自己并肩……\\n当然会心跳加速超级兴奋咯☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "0250eb1ca6b52b9acbc9408f58f3446528f69cd7210c897e2e9c15ff5dace2fd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c619a50bd286ae65d17060f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不管是谁都无法\\n让飞鹰子不去跑步和唱歌♪\\n因为那就是我的赛马娘偶像之路嘛☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f4331bedc7d0e6b5d1c1c81cdc93ebe480195d89578d0891c1820216a573be2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5686c041a9c67146bb58136d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "包装的设计也好棒～♪\\n身为赛马娘偶像就是要\\n连那部分也一起留意到……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "af49dac775d4d3e2855387edfef32bb98f695d7200bca19581137f2b0b3d3501",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "101"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3ddb0f50aaeb91be82e9c1c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "如果把这段舞蹈上传到Umatok的话\\n肯定会立刻爆红！\\n真的还是该拍起来啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c8c48b54e75adebee769d89675ee47343c35d90761558a015eb3c8c9dd051423",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "102"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97d99b37ee643c0530742906",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "大概是听了之后情绪就上来了吧。\\n因为跟混在一起的朋友发生很多事。\\n……该怎么办……去道歉吗……",
      "source_fingerprint": "6df592f3b8a75f9bd3f3e220a56f81b7ad4ab99ce2ac5bfee5673461a267d340",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "103"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:393d12595f4eb8938e1b31b6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "因为我正在修整指甲，\\n所以就麻烦你来首嗨歌吧～",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ecef0b6018635cdbc465fb2416f3a86ee1a6ccbfae867aa84634933328eaa8c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "104"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e510d97f8eee78f2cb904c5e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "就让你们见识一下\\n我的速度有多快……！\\n证明我比任何人都强……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e87ba6ac5e6206a76d34ef13b5575b9eac7bd016a37f27307c12490a6991b2c8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "105"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52c1c0c21853355a82b5cc70",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "跟奖券一起听了之后，\\n她突然就哭了起来……\\n真是静不下来的家伙……",
      "source_fingerprint": "37157c2702e9192cb286ea520bb76a737a565280e3db040b4be9d7331e8b671a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "106"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8dd5167bcd4ac05f9991c4bf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不管哪一首都不错吧……\\n就选你喜欢的如何？",
      "source_fingerprint": "de44ff0c2eba36f343f3caad5bf55259aa3520309336c3e3b06d7bbc2dfd5492",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "107"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb578a20b15b79f6f775e41e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "极限、冲击……\\n我懂！非常非常懂喔！\\n就是「碰！」的感觉对吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e178da7d0226b713f343b4b4eb7f6ea7717bd6a0fe53e29f2f9e82be823f2288",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "108"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b2054198b476451fee9ad8af",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "赛马娘蹦跳♪赛马娘蹦跳♪\\n大家一起唱歌非常开心！\\n跳啊跳啊跳～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1cf157c3101ea6ea98f4f9c62210505da0cab2843e58bfdf36126550fb7e7ca",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "109"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ba7759918af1970e676fe8f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "飘到最高速的副歌\\n令人心情畅快对吧！\\n那可是唱起来最痛快的部分喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f125020ae741a9bd9538d8c65c4aec923f6a559cdf6fe460722e0ee14df387c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dbf4952c6b2985ff7d5bb2fd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我喜欢的是……\\n嗯──全都喜欢～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae6ea1ab122718bce49bbbb839c7fcadec01744a92725451cb9c42f7eb0f892a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "110"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1858b8024250d6df9e82820c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "只要有Shiraoki大人的守护，\\n不论是宿命还是什么的\\n都能立刻被招来身边！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0d2e092a5ac59bc067eff6d60f98ee2aee0f229b40ec7dd51fd8a50bcbbc350",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a04900acc46c82eb3fe3c4bc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "竟然能度过这种\\n被朋友们围绕的青春时光……\\n我是何等地幸运啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b4cb6d6260b74653cede846cab41d3ef19ddd9ac622d8fa07724048dc471f8c2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "112"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:85250fca7ba4d15acbd80574",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "呼哪嘎～哈哪嘎～\\n哪首歌是训练员的幸运之歌～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b97e2c81899a71889181c3cb430fabfe337efc52b1249f4126d6ffbeff50fb7a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "113"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd7d1d176856ae040f674649",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我竟然能和好歌剧\\n在演唱会同台……嘿嘿。\\n真、真希望能多跳一点……",
      "source_fingerprint": "cce6a3c62f5d47927f89fe8790fdb1889efa3016be4fee09b120de6c54472078",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "114"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f0ee41616e7f2f7aabb2a494",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "胜利的女神不可能会眷顾我吧……\\n唉哟……可、可是……\\n只要努力的话，总有一天会……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "02006e767364e6155bf72a4ff91c3f5b737f0aa3ba805f6bf67e5fe5703902f7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "115"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:974fd3f73a61117155274ef7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "洗翻的歌曲……洗翻的嘎起……\\n呜呜～对不起～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b8951d950e5adf883ffbb6abcb1c37e2ddc9fc67414b0345c5c7be8a6f282f00",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "116"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc05d24a3be06de8a8b606ad",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这首歌难在要用严肃的表情跳舞……\\n我的表情基本上都很放松……\\n像这样，所以很难啊……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2057a5e2a828309a7410f4a52a052da9a6764317d8f1b4e112aa8196c2402c0c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "117"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c60cabab4201b19c48ceb73",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "唔喔！青春歌曲来了。\\n这首是那个吧？想跟素质一起\\n奔向梦想……？欸，这里是笑点喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7cf6090189b8942d752c2f6d226d9b261057a556b5ea2edcf19e1dc2152bbfb7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "118"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b290833f6df27581559b03c2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "总觉得会让人想起老家呢。\\n在我们店里也会播放很多种的歌曲。\\n……有些感触良多啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c238584927db336e500b26674f1950be33c4665928b115963958472c61e62e0c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "119"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5d4aceddd2d3a3534a4ad7ba",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最新最酷的歌曲齐聚一堂！\\n这样就算是在舞厅里\\n也肯定会嗨到最高点☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "a426ebcde666088f8856528205a918a44bad547ea80c1190d367a9c6531c9477",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57a7ef49672a30e2e0c47260",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这首歌的速度感正适合\\n最快的一流赛马娘……\\n是有如为帝王而生的一首歌曲！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7daa06a7946d5a292d2de16cbd24417c102ccf695340dbec76df493cdd10f60b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "120"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d14ed288db52a08ae4b03e3f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这首歌的热闹程度会令人上瘾呢。\\n我记得跟特别周她们在一起时，\\n经常会听这首歌。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0458aa404c23394c7482bf4775be7604a8cd8f2c53c7de6ad948653dab941704",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "121"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4de0ca0221afec1d8dcf0588",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "喔～呵呵呵！\\n我就赋予你权利去\\n选择自己喜爱的歌曲吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "05c336d362c6afa08b182009f22b943a5882e1270c33ba3ce9be5520c83e98f2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "122"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:44c69b51457e1930c71eae37",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哦……你喜欢\\n这种歌曲啊。\\n嗯，品味还不差嘛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f486270b862eea30539c833acb2528272a7113a46ad4a71654780ffff2e748b8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "123"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
